ku100.bin is derived from the SADIE II database, subject D1 (Neumann KU100), files
D1_48K_24bit_256tap_FIR_SOFA.sofa and D1_48K_24bit_0.3s_FIR_SOFA.sofa, by
scripts/make_spatial_filters.py (selected directions, level calibration, windowing).

